# Golden vectors for node/streams_local.situ, written by hand from the layout
# in its header comment, so the description is held to a writer other than its
# compiler. 0x0E is FZN_CMD_STREAMS (14); the op is the SUBCMD, 128 (0x80) on.
# The first fix north and east, 30 m up, bearing 90, 5 m east and north and
# 8 m vertical, alice's; the second south and west, no altitude or bearing,
# 10 km either way, coarse, this user's own.

message location    0E 80
message row_full    0E 81 AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 07 00 00 01 8B CF E5 68 00 23 5D 1B 63 0A C4 FE F0 65 53 F1 00 00 1E 00 5A 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 05 00 00 00 08 01 01 00 05 61 6C 69 63 65
message row_coarse  0E 81 AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08 00 00 01 8B CF E5 68 00 DC A2 E4 9D F5 3B 01 10 65 53 F1 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 27 10 00 00 27 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00
